{
  // The cross-package suites are NOT part of test-utils' own source graph —
  // they deliberately reach into sibling packages: accumulator-parity compares
  // four copies of SseFrameAccumulator, and approval-frame-conformance drives
  // packages/server's approval gate through `ai`'s own chunk schema (which
  // packages/server has no dependency on, and should not grow one to hold a
  // test), and finish-frame-conformance validates docs/sse-frame-schema.json —
  // a file at the REPO ROOT — against that same chunk schema. None can live
  // under the package tsconfig's `rootDir: "./src"`
  // (TS6059), and widening that rootDir would change the published dist/
  // layout.
  //
  // Giving them their own no-emit program keeps both fully typechecked while
  // leaving the package's build config untouched.
  //
  // `frame-contract.ts` is the first NON-TEST member of this list, and it belongs
  // for the same stated reason rather than by association: it READS
  // docs/sse-frame-schema.json, the repo-root file named above, so it cannot live
  // under `rootDir: "./src"` either. It is excluded from the package program, so
  // it does not reach dist/ — correct, since nothing in index.ts exports it and a
  // test helper is not published API. Adding `types: ["node"]` to the package
  // config instead would have typechecked it while leaving a repo-root read
  // inside the published source graph.
  //
  // `sdk-declared-chunks.ts` is the second, and it belongs for a DIFFERENT reason worth
  // stating rather than filing it next to its neighbour: it reads no repo-root file. It
  // resolves `ai`'s own declarations out of node_modules and parses them with the
  // TypeScript compiler API, so it needs `types: ["node"]` — which this program sets and
  // the package program deliberately does not. It is excluded from the package program for
  // the same consequence as frame-contract.ts: nothing in index.ts exports it, and a test
  // helper is not published API.
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true,
    "declaration": false,
    "declarationMap": false,
    "types": ["node"],
    "lib": ["ES2020"]
  },
  "include": [
    "src/accumulator-parity.test.ts",
    "src/frame-contract.ts",
    "src/sdk-declared-chunks.ts",
    "src/approval-frame-conformance.test.ts",
    "src/handler-two-programs.check.test.ts",
    "src/error-origin-totality.test.ts",
    "src/approval-pause-conformance.test.ts",
    "src/finish-frame-conformance.test.ts"
  ]
}
